<div class="modal-content gc-preset-modal">
  <div class="modal-body">

    <div class="gc-step gc-preset-intro active">
      <div class="gc-preset-body gc-bg-primary">
        <h1 class="title"><b>Preload from our Library</b></h1>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-sm-6">
            <img src="/static/images/preset-intro.png" width="100%">
          </div>
          <div class="col-sm-6">
            <p class="gc-preset-desc">For the best gymcloud experience we recommend preloading you exercise workout, and program libaries</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="gc-preset-footer">
        <p class="gc-preset-desc">Would you like to preload the list of programs, workouts & exercises to you library?</p>
        <a href="#" class="btn" data-dismiss="modal">
          No
        </a>
        <a href="#" class="btn next-button">
          Yes
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>


    <div class="gc-step gc-preset-step1 ">
      <div class="gc-preset-header gc-bg-primary clearfix">
        <img src="/static/images/preset-intro.png" class="pull-left" width="80px">
        <h4 class="title pull-left"><b>Step 1:</b> Title of the screen</h4>
        <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal">Close</button>
      </div>
      <div class="gc-preset-body">
        <h4 class="title">How would you like to organize your exerise?</h4>
        <p>You will get a folders with programs, workouts, exercises organised due to your needs. In case, you can delete them from library.</p>

        <ul class="gc-modal-options">
          <li>
            <input type="checkbox">
            Type of Equipment (barbell, kettlebell etc) 
          </li>
          <li>
            <input type="checkbox">
            Body Part (chest, arms, etc)
          </li>
          <li>
            <input type="checkbox">
            Movement Pattern (Push, Pull)
          </li>
        </ul>

      </div>
      <div class="gc-preset-footer">
        <a href="#" class="btn btn-link previous-button">
          Previous
        </a>
        <a href="#" class="btn next-button">
          Next
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gc-step gc-preset-step2 ">
      <div class="gc-preset-header gc-bg-primary clearfix">
        <img src="/static/images/preset-intro.png" class="pull-left" width="80px">
        <h4 class="title pull-left"><b>Step 2:</b> Title of the screen</h4>
        <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal">Close</button>
      </div>
      <div class="gc-preset-body">
        <h4 class="title">Select what type of programs you'd like to preload:</h4>

        <ul class="gc-modal-options">
          <li>
            <input type="checkbox">
            Strength
          </li>
          <li>
            <input type="checkbox">
            Muscle Building
          </li>
          <li>
            <input type="checkbox">
            Keeping it fit
          </li>
        </ul>

        <p>
          Nothing here fit your requirements?<br/>
          You can use <a href="#">Global Search in GymCloud</a> to search for a specific programs, workouts & exercise that will fit you more.
        </p>

      </div>
      <div class="gc-preset-footer">
        <a href="#" class="btn btn-link previous-button">
          Previous
        </a>
        <a href="#" class="btn next-button">
          Next
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gc-step gc-preset-success">
      <div class="gc-preset-body gc-bg-primary">
        <h4 class="title">Congratulations, you have successfully preloaded you GymCloud library!</h4>

        <img src="/static/images/preset-whistle.png">

        <p>Are you ready to get started?</p>

        <a href="#" class="btn capitalize" data-dismiss="modal">
          finish
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>
